   "html": "<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n<title>Perennial Plantings</title>\n<script type=\"application/json\" id=\"sp-scheme\">\n{\n \"format\": \"sp-scheme-package\",\n \"spScheme\": \"2.0\",\n \"survey\": {\n  \"title\": \"Perennial Plantings\",\n  \"description\": \"Faithful replication of the preference rating task (Experiment B) in Shi, Zhang, Shen, Chen, Xu, Fu, Su & Xia (2022), Land 11(10):1860, with the authors' 36 photomontages of perennial plant combinations. Participants view each planting for 10 seconds and rate how much they like it from 1 to 10.\",\n  \"locale\": \"en\",\n  \"mediaFolders\": [\n   \"perennials\"\n  ],\n  \"pages\": [\n   {\n    \"name\": \"plantings\",\n    \"elements\": [\n     {\n      \"type\": \"consent\",\n      \"name\": \"consent\",\n      \"title\": \"I have read the information above and agree to take part.\",\n      \"isRequired\": true,\n      \"labelTrue\": \"Yes\",\n      \"labelFalse\": \"No\"\n     },\n     {\n      \"type\": \"imageslidergroup\",\n      \"name\": \"ratings\",\n      \"title\": \"Preference rating per photomontage\",\n      \"isRequired\": true,\n      \"imageCount\": 1,\n      \"scaleMin\": 1,\n      \"scaleMax\": 10,\n      \"description\": \"One row per photomontage (key = <form>_<species>). Form: C = conical, M = mounding, V = vertical, CM / CV / MV = mixes of two forms. Species = number of perennial species in the combination (4–9). Plant arrangement pattern (paper's Figure 1) depends on the species number: 4 = E, 5 = F, 6 = C, 7 = B, 8 = A, 9 = D. All 36 in random order; 3 s centre dot, 10 s viewing, then a 1–10 preference rating. Analysis in the paper: preference by plant form and species richness, by gender and by professional background (planting design professionals vs others), and correlation with eye-movement measures.\",\n      \"dimensions\": [\n       {\n        \"id\": \"preference\",\n        \"label\": \"How much do you like this planting?\",\n        \"left\": \"lowest preference\",\n        \"right\": \"highest preference\",\n        \"min\": 1,\n        \"max\": 10,\n        \"step\": 1\n       }\n      ]\n     }\n    ]\n   },\n   {\n    \"name\": \"about\",\n    \"elements\": [\n     {\n      \"type\": \"radiogroup\",\n      \"name\": \"gender\",\n      \"title\": \"What is your gender?\",\n      \"isRequired\": true,\n      \"choices\": [\n       {\n        \"value\": 1,\n        \"text\": \"Male\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"value\": 2,\n        \"text\": \"Female\"\n       }\n      ]\n     },\n     {\n      \"type\": \"text\",\n      \"name\": \"age\",\n      \"title\": \"How old are you?\",\n      \"isRequired\": true,\n      \"inputType\": \"number\",\n      \"min\": 16,\n      \"max\": 99\n     },\n     {\n      \"type\": \"radiogroup\",\n      \"name\": \"professional\",\n      \"title\": \"Do you work or study in planting or landscape design?\",\n      \"isRequired\": true,\n      \"choices\": [\n       {\n        \"value\": 1,\n        \"text\": \"Yes\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"value\": 2,\n        \"text\": \"No\"\n       }\n      ]\n     }\n    ]\n   }\n  ]\n }\n}\n</script>\n<style>\n:root{--bg:#eef0f2;--card:#fff;--ink:#1b1e22;--muted:#5a616b;--accent:#2f5d62;--accent-ink:#fff;--line:#d5d9de;--warn:#b3261e}\n*{box-sizing:border-box}html,body{margin:0;background:var(--bg);color:var(--ink);font:16px/1.5 system-ui,-apple-system,\"Segoe UI\",Roboto,sans-serif}\nmain{max-width:820px;margin:0 auto;padding:20px 16px 40px}\nh1{font-size:1.4rem;margin:0 0 10px}p{margin:0 0 12px;color:var(--muted)}\n.card{background:var(--card);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:14px;padding:16px;margin-top:14px}\n.btn{appearance:none;border:0;border-radius:10px;padding:12px 20px;font:inherit;font-weight:600;cursor:pointer;background:var(--accent);color:var(--accent-ink)}\n.btn:disabled{opacity:.4;cursor:not-allowed}\n.q{margin-top:18px}.q>b{display:block;margin-bottom:4px}\nlabel.opt{display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:center;padding:9px 12px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:10px;margin-top:6px;cursor:pointer}\ninput[type=number]{font:inherit;padding:8px 10px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:8px;width:120px}\n.pic{background:#000;border-radius:12px;overflow:hidden;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;aspect-ratio:2/1;max-height:min(58vh,560px)}\n.pic img{max-width:100%;max-height:100%;object-fit:contain;display:block}\n.top{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;margin-bottom:8px}\n.t{color:var(--muted);font-size:.9rem;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}\n.bar{height:5px;background:var(--line);border-radius:3px;overflow:hidden;flex:1;margin-left:12px;max-width:260px}.bar>i{display:block;height:100%;background:var(--accent)}\n.qq{font-weight:600;margin:12px 0 6px}\n.sc{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(10,1fr);gap:5px}\n@media (max-width:560px){.sc{grid-template-columns:repeat(5,1fr)}}\n.sc button{appearance:none;border:1px solid var(--line);background:var(--card);color:var(--ink);border-radius:9px;padding:11px 0;font:inherit;font-weight:700;cursor:pointer}\n.sc button.on{background:var(--accent);color:var(--accent-ink);border-color:var(--accent)}\n.dot{width:10px;height:10px;border-radius:50%;background:#fff;display:block}\n.fix{background:#000;border-radius:12px;aspect-ratio:2/1;max-height:min(58vh,560px);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;color:#fff;font-size:3rem;font-weight:300}\n.ends{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;font-size:.82rem;color:var(--muted);margin-top:3px;gap:12px}.ends span:last-child{text-align:right}\n.err{color:var(--warn);margin-top:8px;min-height:1.2em}\n.credit{max-width:820px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 16px 24px;font-size:.78rem;color:var(--muted)}\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main id=\"app\" aria-live=\"polite\"><p>Loading…</p></main>\n<footer class=\"credit\">Photomontages: Shi et al. (2022), Land 11(10):1860, doi:10.3390/land11101860 (CC BY 4.0). Used with credit for research; removed if the authors object.</footer>\n<script>\n(function(){\n  var KEY='perennials2022:';\n  var app=document.getElementById('app'), Q={}, M={}, D=null, ans={}, done={}, order=[];\n  function esc(s){return String(s==null?'':s).replace(/[&<>\"]/g,function(c){return {'&':'&amp;','<':'&lt;','>':'&gt;','\"':'&quot;'}[c];});}\n  function err(m){var e=app.querySelector('.err');if(e)e.textContent=m||'';}\n  function ok(r){return !(r&&r.ok===false);}\n  function load(k){try{return JSON.parse(localStorage.getItem(KEY+k));}catch(e){return null;}}\n  function save(k,v){try{localStorage.setItem(KEY+k,JSON.stringify(v));}catch(e){}}\n  function saveAll(l,b,cb){Promise.all(l.map(function(a){return a[2]?SPSite.answer(a[0],a[1],a[2]):SPSite.answer(a[0],a[1]);})).then(function(rs){var bad=rs.filter(function(r){return !ok(r);})[0];if(bad){if(b)b.disabled=false;return err(bad.error);}cb();});}\n  function shuffle(a){a=a.slice();for(var i=a.length-1;i>0;i--){var j=Math.floor(Math.random()*(i+1)),t=a[i];a[i]=a[j];a[j]=t;}return a;}\n  function stem(n){return n.replace(/\\.[^.]+$/,'');}\n  function list(){return M.perennials||[];}\n  function byName(n){var l=list();for(var i=0;i<l.length;i++)if(l[i].name===n)return l[i];}\n  function next(){\n    window.scrollTo(0,0);\n    if(!ans.intro)return intro();\n    if(!ans.howto)return howto();\n    for(var i=0;i<order.length;i++){if(!done[stem(order[i])])return trial(i);}\n    if(!ans.about)return about();\n    finish();\n  }\n  function page(title,html,btn,cb){\n    app.innerHTML='<div class=\"card\">'+(title?'<h1>'+esc(title)+'</h1>':'')+html+'<div style=\"margin-top:16px\"><button class=\"btn\" id=\"go\">'+esc(btn||'Continue')+'</button></div><div class=\"err\"></div></div>';\n    document.getElementById('go').onclick=cb;\n  }\n  function radios(name){return (Q[name].choices||[]).map(function(c){return '<label class=\"opt\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"'+name+'\" value=\"'+esc(c.value)+'\"> '+esc(c.text)+'</label>';}).join('');}\n  function val(n){var x=app.querySelector('input[name='+n+']:checked');return x?Number(x.value):null;}\n  function intro(){\n    if(list().length<36){app.innerHTML='<h1>Pictures missing</h1><p>Media folder perennials must hold the 36 photomontages.</p>';return;}\n    page('Which perennial plantings do you like?','<p>In this study you will see '+list().length+' pictures of small perennial flower plantings, one at a time, and rate how much you like each one. It takes about 10 to 15 minutes.</p><p>Participation is voluntary and anonymous.</p><label class=\"opt\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"ok\"> '+esc(Q.consent.title)+'</label>','Start',function(){\n      if(!document.getElementById('ok').checked)return err('Consent is needed to continue.');\n      var b=this;b.disabled=true;saveAll([['consent',true]],b,function(){ans.intro=true;next();});\n    });\n  }\n  function howto(){\n    page('Instructions','<p style=\"color:var(--ink)\">Before each picture a dot appears in the centre of the screen for 3 seconds; please look at it. Then the picture is shown for 10 seconds. Please look over the whole picture.</p><p style=\"color:var(--ink)\">After that, rate how much you like the planting from <b>1 = lowest</b> to <b>10 = highest preference</b>. Go with your first impression and do not think about it for too long.</p>','Begin',function(){ans.howto=true;next();});\n  }\n  var timer=null;\n  function trial(i){\n    var f=byName(order[i]), n=0, k=stem(f.name);order.forEach(function(x){if(done[stem(x)])n++;});\n    var head='<div class=\"top\"><span class=\"t\">Picture '+(n+1)+' of '+order.length+'</span><div class=\"bar\"><i style=\"width:'+(100*n/order.length)+'%\"></i></div></div>';\n    var pre=new Image();pre.src=f.url;\n    app.innerHTML=head+'<div class=\"fix\"><span class=\"dot\"></span></div>';\n    clearTimeout(timer);\n    timer=setTimeout(function(){\n      app.innerHTML=head+'<div class=\"pic\"><img alt=\"Photomontage of a perennial planting\" src=\"'+esc(f.url)+'\"></div><p class=\"t\" style=\"margin-top:8px\">Please look over the whole picture.</p>';\n      timer=setTimeout(function(){rate(f,k,head);},10000);\n    },3000);\n  }\n  function rate(f,k,head){\n    var b='';for(var v=D.min;v<=D.max;v++)b+='<button type=\"button\" data-v=\"'+v+'\">'+v+'</button>';\n    app.innerHTML=head+'<div class=\"qq\">'+esc(D.label)+'</div><div class=\"sc\">'+b+'</div><div class=\"ends\"><span>1 = '+esc(D.left)+'</span><span>10 = '+esc(D.right)+'</span></div><div class=\"err\"></div>';\n    var busy=false;\n    app.querySelectorAll('.sc button').forEach(function(x){x.onclick=function(){\n      if(busy)return;busy=true;x.classList.add('on');\n      SPSite.answer('ratings',{preference:Number(x.dataset.v)},{key:k,shown:[f.name]}).then(function(r){\n        if(!ok(r)){busy=false;x.classList.remove('on');return err(r.error);}\n        done[k]=true;setTimeout(next,150);});\n    };});\n  }\n  function about(){\n    page('About you','<div class=\"q\"><b>'+esc(Q.gender.title)+'</b>'+radios('gender')+'</div><div class=\"q\"><b>'+esc(Q.age.title)+'</b><input type=\"number\" name=\"age\" min=\"16\" max=\"99\" inputmode=\"numeric\"></div><div class=\"q\"><b>'+esc(Q.professional.title)+'</b>'+radios('professional')+'</div>','Finish',function(){\n      var g=val('gender');if(!g)return err('Please answer: '+Q.gender.title);\n      var a=Number((app.querySelector('input[name=age]')||{}).value);if(!a||a<16||a>99)return err('Please enter your age in years.');\n      var p=val('professional');if(!p)return err('Please answer: '+Q.professional.title);\n      var b=this;b.disabled=true;saveAll([['gender',g],['age',a],['professional',p]],b,function(){ans.about=true;next();});\n    });\n  }\n  function finish(){\n    app.innerHTML='<h1>Thank you!</h1><div class=\"card\"><p>The pictures combined perennials of different plant forms (conical, mounding, vertical and their mixes) with 4 to 9 species. In the original eye-tracking study in Hangzhou, China, plant form and species richness changed how people looked at the plantings, men and women liked them about equally, and people without a planting design background gave clearly higher ratings than professionals.</p><p style=\"font-size:.82rem\">Photomontages and task: Shi, Y., Zhang, J., Shen, X., Chen, L., Xu, Y., Fu, R., Su, Y., &amp; Xia, Y. (2022). Designing perennial landscapes: Plant form and species richness influence the gaze perception associated with aesthetic preference. Land 11(10):1860, doi:10.3390/land11101860. Used with credit and removed if the authors object.</p><p id=\"fin\">Submitting…</p><div class=\"err\"></div></div>';\n    SPSite.complete().then(function(r){if(!ok(r)){err(r.error||'Some answers are missing.');var m=r.missing||[];setTimeout(function(){m.forEach(function(x){\n      if(x==='consent')ans.intro=false;else if(x==='ratings')done={};else ans.about=false;});next();},1800);}\n      else{var s=document.getElementById('fin');if(s)s.textContent='Your answers have been saved. You can close this window now.';}});\n  }\n  SPSite.onReady(function(ctx){\n    ['consent','gender','age','professional'].forEach(function(n){Q[n]=SPSite.getQuestion(n)||{};});\n    var R=SPSite.getQuestion('ratings')||{};D=(R.dimensions||[])[0]||{label:'How much do you like this planting?',left:'lowest preference',right:'highest preference',min:1,max:10};\n    M.perennials=(SPSite.getMedia('perennials')||[]).slice();\n    var a=(ctx&&ctx.answers)||{};\n    var names=list().map(function(f){return f.name;});var o=load('order');\n    if(!o||o.length!==names.length||o.some(function(x){return names.indexOf(x)<0;}))o=shuffle(names);order=o;save('order',order);\n    ((a.ratings&&a.ratings.trials)||[]).forEach(function(t){if(t.key)done[t.key]=true;});\n    if(a.consent===true){ans.intro=true;if(Object.keys(done).length)ans.howto=true;}\n    if(a.professional!=null)ans.about=true;\n    next();\n  });\n})();\n</script>\n</body>\n</html>\n",
